{"2646170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Arms Are Longer Now", "steam_appid": 2646170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.poster.avif?t=1784566032\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.webm?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.mp4?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a long-armed thief. Your arm is like a yucky snake.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/24c1e7245bc625e1028c8a404306ead8.poster.avif?t=1784566032\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/24c1e7245bc625e1028c8a404306ead8.webm?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/24c1e7245bc625e1028c8a404306ead8.mp4?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Arms Are Longer Now is a 2D stealth-comedy game. With your disgusting long arm, you’ll avoid security systems, steal whatever isn’t bolted down, put a sock on your hand and flirt with a lonely guard - whatever it takes to pull off the perfect heist!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/9de452f74b0c60b766afc8083cf847d3.poster.avif?t=1784566032\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/9de452f74b0c60b766afc8083cf847d3.webm?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/9de452f74b0c60b766afc8083cf847d3.mp4?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arm that retracts like a vacuum cord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hard-boiled detective on your tail (or shoulder?), one week from retirement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riches like you wouldn’t believe (at least 60 bucks!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/9936fae1aa2fff0a850a4e15e1c032cd.avif?t=1784566032\" width=600 height=296 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.poster.avif?t=1784566032\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.webm?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/274120ad1d7d94cfa02eec2bfe910f2b.mp4?t=1784566032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are a long-armed thief. Your arm is like a yucky snake.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\